# Image visual lock (do not regress)

Polymer screenshots (EVA astronaut, job-firing “Termination”, handshake “Initiation”, typeset titles on photos) happened because prompts used the **short tab label only**. Do not go back to that. `npm test` must stay green (`src/lib/imageVisualPrompt.test.ts`, `src/lib/contentImageJobs.test.ts`, `src/lib/contentImageBatch.test.ts`, `src/lib/draftMedia.test.ts`).

## Invariants (code, not prompts)

- **Grounded subject:** every AI image goes through `buildGroundedVisualPrompt` in [`src/lib/imageVisualPrompt.ts`](src/lib/imageVisualPrompt.ts). Pass course title, module title, slide title, panel label, **panel body**, and `mediaPrompt`. Never prompt with the label alone (`EVA`, `Termination`, `Initiation`, `Monomer`).
- **Homonyms:** resolve technical meaning in this course’s domain. EVA = ethylene-vinyl acetate resin, not an astronaut. Termination = radical chain ending, not a firing. Initiation = free-radical attack, not a handshake.
- **No text in the picture:** `IMAGE_NO_TEXT_RULE` / `withImageNoTextRule` on every `/api/generate-image` call. Blank packaging, bottles, screens, signs. The player already shows titles.
- **Vision QA:** [`server.js`](server.js) `POST /api/generate-image` reviews the result (`hasVisibleText` / `offTopic`) and retries once. Client sends `intended` from the grounded builder. Skip review on failure; do not drop the first image. **Cover / single-image AI keeps QA.** Edit → Generate AI images (the 14) sends `skipQa: true` so the first picture returns before Cloudflare 524 / the 60s client abort. Do not put Vision QA back on the bulk path.
- **Generic mediaPrompt** like `Professional illustration related to …` is ignored; use panel body instead.

## Click & Reveal canvas

Intro / prompt on the **left**; reveal rows on the **right**, not a full-width stack. [`src/components/interactions/ClickRevealInteraction.tsx`](src/components/interactions/ClickRevealInteraction.tsx). Do not restore stacked full-width fields that leave empty space after reveal.

## Authoring AI images (do not regress)

- **In-flow by default.** Generated tab/content images stay `imageUrl` / `introImageUrl` in the column. Do **not** auto-promote with `fi-ai-` / `fi-promo-` (overlays tab titles). `stripCourseAutoPromotedFloating` stays.
- **Crop / move / resize like uploads:** authoring chrome on [`EnlargeableImage`](src/components/player/EnlargeableImage.tsx) (Crop + Move) lifts into [`FloatingImageCanvas`](src/components/FloatingImageCanvas.tsx) with id `fi-${Date.now()}`. Uploads still go straight to the float canvas.
- **Cover photo is the same chrome.** Title-slide image stays cover-scale in the right panel until Crop / Move / Delete. Move lifts it onto `__cover__` floats (`course.coverFloatingMedia`) and sets `coverPanelHidden` so the empty blue-gray well does not remain as a border. Delete / X drops `coverImage` and sets `coverPanelHidden`. Title alignment is `coverTitleAlign` (`left` default, plus center/right). Do not auto-center the title when the panel is hidden. **AI** on the photo and **Edit → Regenerate cover image** call `regenerateCoverImage` (wait for `/api/health`, retry `Failed to fetch`; do not no-op while content images are running). Do not restore hover-replace-only cover authoring. Cover 429 is an image rate-limit: [`worker.js`](worker.js) maps Render HTML 429 to JSON `UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMIT` (never “try Sync”) and must **not retry 429/524**. Non-JSON 524/504 on `/api/generate-image` maps to `UPSTREAM_TIMEOUT`. Edit → Generate AI images uses [`publicImageError`](src/lib/apiWarmup.ts) so the toast is never a bare “Error”. [`imageLimitKey`](server.js) is per Bearer token (prod `trust proxy`), `skipFailedRequests: true` so dropped/warming POSTs do not eat the 60/15min bucket, and the toast comes from [`formatImageApiError`](src/lib/apiWarmup.ts). Do not send every author through one Render load-balancer IP bucket. `POST /api/generate-image` tries OpenAI `gpt-image-1-mini` first (confirmed live; `dall-e-3` / `gpt-image-1` are retired). OpenRouter Gemini/Flux is backup only, `/images` not chat. Do not abort the batch on the first 429.
- **Main Menu image is persisted.** Hub uses `course.hubImage` from the theme archive (`/eLearning Template Backgrounds/…`), not `getRandomBackgroundForTheme` / `courseBg` and not the cover photo. `ensureHubImage` stamps one still on first hub open and keeps it. Authoring chrome is Crop / Move / Delete / **Swap** (picker over the same archive). Do not pick a new random still when a draft is reopened.
- **Deletes and enlargements persist.** Removing an in-flow image or promoting it to a float must drop `imageUrl` / tab `imageUrl` / `introImageUrl` (`omitUndefinedDeep`). Draft load must **not** reattach leftover IndexedDB/cloud blobs onto missing keys (`attachHeavyMedia` + `hasOwnMediaPath`). Save prunes stale image asset paths (`mergeDraftAssetPaths`). Do not union previous image paths forever. `npm test` must stay green (`src/lib/draftMedia.test.ts`).
- **Edit → Generate AI images** opens a slide checklist of remaining empty slots (`collectContentImageJobs`). Skips quizzes/objectives and slides that already have `imageUrl` or a slide-level float. Author-initiated generate bypasses `topicBenefitsFromVisual` so composition/abstract content slides still appear on the list. Auto-gen after Build still uses the heuristic and caps at `MAX_CONTENT_AI_IMAGES` (14). The picker lists every empty slot (`noCap`); default-checks slides covering the first 14 pictures (`slideIdsCoveringPictures`). **Check all** + Generate runs every selected slot — do not `slice(0, 14)` on confirm. Past 14, the dialog warns (1 credit and ~20s each). Copy names **pictures** and **slides** separately. **Bulk is sequential** (`CONTENT_IMAGE_CONCURRENCY` = 1, ~2s pace, 60s timeout, one HTTP attempt). On 429 wait `retryAfterMs` (~25s) and retry that slot once, then continue remaining slides. Stop the batch only on 401/402/403. Do not restore concurrency 2 + inner `waitForApiWarm` retries on this path — that sat at 0 of 14 then toasted rate-limit. Toast ticks `tried` when a job starts. `npm test` must stay green (`src/lib/contentImageJobs.test.ts`, `src/lib/contentImageBatch.test.ts`).
- **Edit → Generate AI image for this slide** passes `{ slideId }` — that slide’s empty slots only. Never a course-wide refill.
- **Images only.** `applyContentImageUrl` writes `imageUrl` / `introImageUrl` / tab `imageUrl`. It must not rewrite OST, voice-over, interaction type, tab labels, or tab copy.

## How to change this

Change the helpers and add a failing test first. Prompt-only “no text / be thoughtful” instructions will drift.
